{"description":"Admins: invite an email to this workspace with a role, optionally limited to agentIds (viewer/editor/operator only). SAGOT emails the invitation when email is configured; the one-time link path (/join#member=\u2026) is also returned once as a fallback. The invitee signs in or creates an account with that email. Only the owner can invite admins. Re-inviting an email replaces its earlier pending invitation.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"agentIds":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"},"maxItems":200,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},{"type":"null"}]},"email":{"format":"email","maxLength":254,"pattern":"^(?:[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]+\\.)*[A-Za-z0-9_'+\\-]*[A-Za-z0-9_+-]@(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9\\-]*\\.)+[A-Za-z]{2,}$","type":"string"},"expiresInDays":{"default":7,"maximum":30,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"role":{"enum":["viewer","editor","operator","admin"],"type":"string"},"workspaceId":{"format":"uuid","pattern":"^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$","type":"string"}},"required":["workspaceId","email","role"],"type":"object"},"name":"members_invite"}
